  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans (A. ferrooxidans) used in this study was isolated from the acidic groundwater near the sampling site, the strain was cultured in 9 K medium containing (per litre): 3 g (NH4)2SO4, 1 g KCl, 0.5 g K2HPO4, 0.5 g MgSO4·7H2O, 0.001 g Ca(NO3)2, and 44.2 g FeSO4·7H2O, the pH of medium was adjusted to 2.50 by using 0.1 M H2SO4."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}